# BBS signatures, draft-irtf-cfrg-bbs-signatures-08, section 3.7.3
# (ProofVerify): selective disclosure from a BBS signature, shown with
# two of the messages withheld.
#
# The two equations are the T1 and T2 relations of the verifier.  The
# first ties the randomised signature to the secret e and the
# randomiser r1; the second opens the randomised commitment D and the
# withheld messages against their own generators.
secrets e r1 r3 m_j1 m_j2
claims  e r1 r3 m_j1 m_j2
eq  Bbar   Abar  D   1  1     1
eq  Bv     1     1   D  H_j1  H_j2
